# Generated build output lands here and IS committed:
#   drone.glb, manifest.json, preview.png,
#   fea/*.glb, drawings/*.svg, downloads/*.step|stl|dxf
#
# Committed rather than built in CI because rebuilding needs a 400 MB OCCT
# wheel plus gmsh, and because it guarantees the published page is exactly
# what was tested locally. See .github/workflows/pages.yml for the reasoning.
